HANDOFF-*.md
*-AUDIT.md
VERIFICATION.md
docs/**/*.md
.dsh-tmp/

# Screenshots and JSON written by scripts/probe-dom.mjs, verify-dom.mjs, verify-tts-regressions.mjs
artifacts/
